#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:3
#: ae874b576d31440ca861535e9bd0799f
msgid "成分空间采样（Composition Space Sampling）"
msgstr "Composition Space Sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:5
#: 039f3d2730df4f778a622ae446aef184
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:7
#: 25a7e86296d04089b618398e3960c9c4
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:9
#: 1899d740d2ea4109b998a66689ac368c
msgid ""
"这张卡为每个输入结构生成一组**不重复的目标成分**，并把目标写入 `Config_type` 的 `Comp(...)` "
"标签。它只制定“要采哪些成分”，不会改变原子种类、原子数、坐标或晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Generate a set of **unique target compositions** for each input structure and write "
"each target to a `Comp(...)` label in `Config_type`. The card specifies which "
"compositions to sample; it does not change atomic species, atom count, coordinates, "
"or the cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:11
#: 807b3e00522e4f799333179c927c5afb
msgid ""
"若要得到真正具有这些成分的结构，请在后面连接**随机占位（Random Occupancy）**卡片。随机占位会读取 "
"`Comp(...)`，再按晶胞中的原子数把比例换算为各元素的整数原子数。"
msgstr ""
"To obtain structures that actually realize these compositions, connect **Random "
"Occupancy** downstream. It reads `Comp(...)` and converts the fractions into integer "
"atom counts according to the number of atoms in the cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:13
#: c74dcafda1224df296ecec013e8b667d
msgid ""
"如果输入已经带有 `Comp(...)`，本卡会用新目标替换旧目标，避免下游读到过期成分。其他 `Config_type` "
"标签保持不变；cell、PBC、positions、`spin` 和 `initial_magmoms` 等数据也保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"If an input already contains `Comp(...)`, this card replaces the old target with the "
"new one so downstream operations do not read a stale composition. Other `Config_type`"
" labels remain unchanged, as do data such as the cell, PBC, positions, `spin`, and "
"`initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:15
#: 03d89ea0d40e465a94b1b7cbf83bf3f3
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:17
#: 29255e8c57d848c0a7b80b6cc99e21cc
msgid "设候选元素池含 $E$ 种元素，选择 $K$ 元成分时共有"
msgstr ""
"For a candidate pool containing $E$ elements, choosing a $K$-component composition "
"gives"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:19
#: bd3edfb9a4d44853be439bf8263777b5
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{comb}}(E,K)=\\binom{E}{K}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:23
#: fa3eeb6c13f745ffa09f636c015ce136
msgid "种元素组合。每个组合都在满足"
msgstr ""
"element combinations. Each combination is sampled on the composition simplex "
"satisfying"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:25
#: dfb68b88de6849c0a890f05288e83cca
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_i\\ge 0,\\qquad \\sum_{i=1}^{K}x_i=1\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:29
#: 728902409f2a495ea81c31711e00686c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "的成分单纯形上采样；若最小比例为 $x_{\\min}$，还要求每个被包含的元素满足 $x_i\\ge x_{\\min}$。"
msgstr ""
"If the minimum fraction is $x_{\\min}$, every included element must additionally "
"satisfy $x_i\\ge x_{\\min}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:31
#: 5a5b0972097d41d5a4c992f982449137
msgid "Grid 网格采样"
msgstr "Grid Sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:33
#: 0589040900194c0f96cc4d1c42fdbdfd
msgid "当步长为 $s=1/n$ 且包含边界时，一个 $K$ 元组合的网格点数为"
msgstr ""
"When the step is $s=1/n$ and boundaries are included, the number of grid points for "
"one $K$-component combination is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:35
#: df80c15619cc4e1bbb22b4b85c8e8c2d
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{grid}}=\\binom{n+K-1}{K-1}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:39
#: ccae234b240b415daaaa50653eb29482
msgid "不包含边界且所有比例必须大于 0 时，点数为"
msgstr ""
"When boundaries are excluded and all fractions must be greater than zero, the number "
"of points is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:41
#: 504d9c96688e4505a8a9e718d98e0a59
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{interior}}=\\binom{n-1}{K-1}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:45
#: e0f46d61eed64cb4a3365943e2cdae7f
msgid ""
"四元和五元网格要求步长可写成 $1/n$，例如 0.1 或 0.05；否则卡片会明确报错。 为避免参数预览构造过大的网格，单个组元数最多允许 100000 "
"个单纯形网格模板；超过时应增大步长或改用 Sobol。"
msgstr ""
"Quaternary and quinary grids require a step expressible as $1/n$, such as 0.1 or "
"0.05; otherwise the card reports an explicit error. To prevent the parameter preview "
"from constructing an excessively large grid, at most 100000 simplex-grid templates "
"are allowed for one component count. Increase the step or use Sobol when this limit "
"is exceeded."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:48
#: 6440fbe83dde439f9202e6dd414d6024
msgid "Sobol 准随机采样"
msgstr "Sobol Quasirandom Sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:50
#: d741f91e5d014f5bafb28cd7cb777cee
msgid ""
"Sobol 模式把 `n_points` 作为每一种元素组合的候选容量。它适合高维成分空间，数量更容易控制；若候选容量大于最终输出预算，程序只计算填满预算所需的 "
"Sobol 前缀，不会先构造全部候选点。seed 决定点集和预算截断时的目标顺序。"
msgstr ""
"In Sobol mode, `n_points` is the candidate capacity for each element combination. It "
"is well suited to high-dimensional composition spaces and makes the count easier to "
"control. If candidate capacity exceeds the final output budget, the program computes "
"only the Sobol prefix needed to fill the budget rather than constructing every "
"candidate first. The seed determines both the point set and the target order when the"
" budget truncates it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:52
#: 30af4bb2f8924abeaa0f18fe5fce97af
msgid "去重、预算和输出数"
msgstr "Deduplication, Budget, and Output Count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:54
#: efb4cc308a3e4c03abc5d413e523aec6
msgid ""
"单纯形边界上的零比例点可能在二元、三元等不同名义阶数中表示同一个实际成分。本卡会先移除零比例元素，再对所有阶数全局去重。例如默认元素 `Co,Cr,Ni`、Grid 步长"
" 0.1、选择二元和三元时，边界去重后每个输入得到 **66** 个目标，而不是名义容量相加得到的 99 个。"
msgstr ""
"A zero-fraction point on a simplex boundary may represent the same realized "
"composition under different nominal orders, such as binary and ternary. The card "
"first removes zero-fraction elements, then deduplicates globally across all orders. "
"For example, with default elements `Co,Cr,Ni`, Grid step 0.1, and both binary and "
"ternary orders selected, boundary deduplication gives **66** targets per input rather"
" than the nominal-capacity sum of 99."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:56
#: 273d4e8c91884f62945984fe8f87d132
msgid ""
"`max_outputs` 是**每个输入结构**的上限，范围为 1–10000。若每个输入最终有 $N_{\\mathrm{unique}}$ 个唯一目标，输入结构数为"
" $N_{\\mathrm{in}}$，则"
msgstr ""
"`max_outputs` is a limit **per input structure**, in the range 1–10000. If each input"
" ultimately has $N_{\\mathrm{unique}}$ unique targets and there are "
"$N_{\\mathrm{in}}$ input structures, then"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:58
#: 9aece49f64184894a13a017564577f34
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}\\times N_{\\mathrm{unique}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:62
#: df2c80d12dc14deabe9cb93994afa1eb
msgid "预算分配有三种方式："
msgstr "Three budget-allocation modes are available:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:64
#: e20dad17f758477089b33fa3f830a21f
msgid "`Equal+Reflow`：先在可行阶数间均分，某一阶数用不完时把余额转给其他阶数。"
msgstr ""
"`Equal+Reflow`: divide the budget equally among feasible orders first, then transfer "
"unused capacity from one order to the others."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:65
#: 508144754f644e2597682e1267318f53
msgid "`Capacity-weighted`：按各阶数的名义容量分配，较大的成分空间获得更多目标。"
msgstr ""
"`Capacity-weighted`: allocate according to the nominal capacity of each order, giving"
" more targets to larger composition spaces."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:66
#: ca96ca87040f4c1f9c6235f8e3179747
msgid "`Equal (legacy)`：按旧逻辑均分，不回收未用完的份额。"
msgstr ""
"`Equal (legacy)`: divide equally using the old behavior without reclaiming unused "
"shares."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:68
#: f4df2b0a49ca4851a1d9d2d9c62bfee4
msgid "候选元素不足时，不可行的阶数会跳过并显示在预览中；若没有任何可行阶数或没有可用目标，则运行失败而不是原样返回输入。"
msgstr ""
"When there are too few candidate elements, infeasible orders are skipped and shown in"
" the preview. If no order is feasible or no target is available, the operation fails "
"instead of returning the input unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:70
#: e3549a8ff48a493488b3059ae204b3d7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:72
#: b9dd2caa2e66406ba8f0ab57ac871cd2
msgid "假设训练集中只有 Co、Cr、Ni 的少数固定化学计量比，希望补足二元边界和三元内部成分："
msgstr ""
"Suppose a training set contains only a few fixed Co–Cr–Ni stoichiometries and needs "
"better coverage of binary boundaries and the ternary interior:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:74
#: 5428d72b289d4eb59e4f18a1ef0e24f9
msgid "将候选元素设为 `Co,Cr,Ni`，组元数保留默认的“二元 + 三元（2,3）”。"
msgstr ""
"Set candidate elements to `Co,Cr,Ni` and keep the default component counts, `Binary +"
" Ternary (2,3)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:75
#: e8a8542ea478426b9510e11c3f1b33f9
msgid "选择 Grid，步长设为 0.1，并保留单纯形边界。"
msgstr "Select Grid, set the step to 0.1, and include simplex boundaries."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:76
#: d758e81e163e4c1da211a6c47a42ca53
msgid "保持每个输入最多 500 个唯一目标。预览应显示二元和三元可行，共 66 个唯一目标/输入。"
msgstr ""
"Keep a maximum of 500 unique targets per input. The preview should show that both "
"binary and ternary orders are feasible, with 66 unique targets per input in total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:77
#: 60813f7c9a5347ab86f22c5d09118ef8
msgid "在本卡后连接随机占位，使 `Comp(...)` 目标真正转化为原子种类。"
msgstr ""
"Connect Random Occupancy after this card so the `Comp(...)` target is actually "
"converted into atomic species."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:78
#: 7fdf27ebc53f44f4aa5a23d3a26db655
msgid "导出前检查实际元素计数；有限原子数会使连续比例发生整数取整，因此实际比例可能略偏离标签目标。"
msgstr ""
"Check realized element counts before export. A finite atom count requires integer "
"rounding of continuous fractions, so the realized fraction may differ slightly from "
"the label target."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:80
#: 8677635bc0fe498a99ad3a1d63302c28
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:82
#: f14fba1dbdaa47bbb7e801896edd9dd2
msgid "成分空间"
msgstr "Composition Space"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:84
#: 00e34b35b1a34baa99a1a84395ad1ea7
msgid "候选元素（elements）"
msgstr "Candidate Elements (elements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:86
#: bc58300280244f15809edda9013e02bf
msgid "逗号分隔的合法元素符号，至少两个，例如 `Co,Cr,Ni,Al`。重复元素会被合并。"
msgstr ""
"Comma-separated valid element symbols, at least two, for example `Co,Cr,Ni,Al`. "
"Duplicate elements are merged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:88
#: 0d66b0abfde24f338a478391a92407e4
msgid "组元数（order）"
msgstr "Component Count (order)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:90
#: 5396d783340f4f82a98ef8ea528858f4
msgid "选择要采样的名义组元数：二元、三元、四元、五元或其组合。候选元素数量不足的阶数会跳过。"
msgstr ""
"Select the nominal component counts to sample: binary, ternary, quaternary, quinary, "
"or a combination. Orders with too few candidate elements are skipped."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:92
#: fdca50da839a495e9f78c25d0c8cbe13
msgid "单纯形采样"
msgstr "Simplex Sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:94
#: 283bf229f40a4f71868eaf9b057d53e6
msgid "采样方法（method）"
msgstr "method"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:96
#: 6c77cbc8262941bfbef5a3b4abf10ad7
msgid "`Grid`：规则网格，适合低维空间和可解释的固定间隔。"
msgstr ""
"`Grid`: a regular grid suited to low-dimensional spaces and interpretable fixed "
"intervals."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:97
#: a48215e758494cbb84f9c44f16050ee2
msgid "`Sobol`：低差异准随机点，适合四元、五元空间或严格控制点数。"
msgstr ""
"`Sobol`: low-discrepancy quasirandom points suited to quaternary or quinary spaces "
"and tight control of point count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:99
#: b9f8fd376a6d4233bc38aa5ea2422a43
msgid "网格比例步长（step）"
msgstr "Grid Fraction Step (step)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:101
#: 3bbe6efcd5764ec5a12f41ed5ed00f99
msgid "仅 Grid 生效。范围 0.001–1，默认 0.1，表示比例按 0.1 递增。步长过密并超过安全网格规模时会报错，此时应增大步长或使用 Sobol。"
msgstr ""
"Used only by Grid. Range 0.001–1, default 0.1, meaning fractions increase in "
"increments of 0.1. If a dense step exceeds the safe grid size, an error is reported; "
"increase the step or use Sobol."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:103
#: 3e48f20ed134410cbcd19a1c1594db00
msgid "每种元素组合的 Sobol 点数（n_points）"
msgstr "Sobol Points per Element Combination (n_points)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:105
#: 814aba10bccb4a3cac3ca05e307715ef
msgid "仅 Sobol 生效。默认 50；这是每一种元素组合的候选点数，最终仍受去重和每输入预算限制。"
msgstr ""
"Used only by Sobol. Default 50; this is the candidate point count for each element "
"combination, still subject to deduplication and the per-input budget."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:107
#: 6d08d97c0bd1448199ab1fde7a3c66ec
msgid "每个已包含元素的最小比例（min_fraction）"
msgstr "Minimum Fraction of Each Included Element (min_fraction)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:109
#: 2db76c36f95e482da4becd72df423b00
msgid "默认 0。增大后会把采样限制在满足该下限的截断单纯形内；若下限达到或超过当前组元数的等摩尔比例，可能只剩一个点或没有可用目标。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0. Increasing it restricts sampling to a truncated simplex satisfying this "
"lower bound. If the lower bound reaches or exceeds the equimolar fraction for the "
"current component count, only one point or no usable target may remain."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:111
#: fc52fc5defbb4486b378a9df05c7efb8
msgid "包含单纯形边界（include_endpoints）"
msgstr "Include Simplex Boundaries (include_endpoints)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:113
#: 6eb3f369d6c44514a0f2ac2e429d4f96
msgid "仅 Grid 生效。开启时允许某些比例为 0，因此会产生低阶边界目标；这些目标会跨阶数去重。"
msgstr ""
"Used only by Grid. When enabled, some fractions may be zero, producing lower-order "
"boundary targets. These targets are deduplicated across orders."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:115
#: c357fcbb264844d7b50390577cd67ee7
msgid "输出预算"
msgstr "Output Budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:117
#: a391ff76f2014250a5b6e25a056ef37f
msgid "每个输入的最大唯一目标数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Unique Targets per Input (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:119
#: ecba459f43c14b95973189a392d01bcb
msgid "默认 500，可设为 1–10000。限制对每个输入结构独立应用。"
msgstr ""
"Default 500, configurable from 1 to 10000. The limit is applied independently to each"
" input structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:121
#: 638812fc60be4c74aa3a89cba1c9e20f
msgid "预算分配（budget_mode）"
msgstr "Budget Allocation (budget_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:123
#: 7eeffdec22bc4f79a221d8eb15ca6c37
msgid "可选 `Equal+Reflow`、`Capacity-weighted` 或 `Equal (legacy)`，含义见“去重、预算和输出数”。"
msgstr ""
"Choose `Equal+Reflow`, `Capacity-weighted`, or `Equal (legacy)`; see `Deduplication, "
"Budget, and Output Count` for their meanings."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:125
#: d12dd0f2f89449a08915b5f09896c914
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:127
#: 18c6563a6a1c4597973f57de66e78dfe
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:129
#: 6e9fe2fb7b554d7cbedc4494a78a17f2
msgid "开启后固定 Sobol 点集、元素组合顺序以及预算截断时的目标顺序。"
msgstr ""
"When enabled, this fixes the Sobol point set, element-combination order, and target "
"order when the budget truncates results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:131
#: 79cd1b849a964f3086b2d9dbf3fbc6ed
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:133
#: cb6783727014495a97aeb36ae1865350
msgid "非负整数，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。"
msgstr "Nonnegative integer, used only when `use_seed=true`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:135
#: 96e631d0000641da9ad94967ea5c7987
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:137
#: 602a8b862a344dfeaa2cd831bcf66aff
msgid "为什么输出结构的元素没有变化？"
msgstr "Why Have the Elements in the Output Structure Not Changed?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:139
#: a28cbe47a9a644c1883d56f1d29f05e9
msgid "本卡只写目标标签。请在后面连接随机占位卡片，才会按目标成分修改原子种类。"
msgstr ""
"This card writes only a target label. Connect Random Occupancy downstream to change "
"atomic species according to the target composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:141
#: e54287b4300a44e183ea05b19f9cedfe
msgid "为什么实际输出少于名义网格点数？"
msgstr "Why Is the Actual Output Count Smaller Than the Nominal Grid Count?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:143
#: 0b6489c7a1204208bf60fc1016a5a83d
msgid "常见原因是跨阶数边界重复、最小比例过滤或每输入预算截断。右侧预览给出的是去重后的精确数量。"
msgstr ""
"Common causes are duplicate boundaries across orders, minimum-fraction filtering, or "
"truncation by the per-input budget. The preview on the right shows the exact count "
"after deduplication."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:145
#: 7f3265a627fc4260b5f296d7f6ee07d7
msgid "为什么随机占位后的比例与目标略有差异？"
msgstr "Why Does the Fraction after Random Occupancy Differ Slightly from the Target?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:147
#: 1c40b1f199a349768ef8dbc730adb6d4
msgid "有限晶胞只能容纳整数个原子。增大晶胞可减小比例取整误差；扩胞应由单独的扩胞卡片完成。"
msgstr ""
"A finite cell can contain only an integer number of atoms. Increasing the cell size "
"reduces fraction-rounding error; expansion should be performed by a separate Super "
"Cell card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:149
#: 19de5e00e7904ba2830fd20c4787e521
msgid "序列化参数是什么？"
msgstr "What Are the Serialized Parameters?"

