#~ msgid "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy`：先定义目标配比，再落到离散原子占位。合金 pipeline 的标准起手式。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy`: define"
#~ " target fractions, then realize discrete "
#~ "occupations; the standard alloy workflow."

#~ msgid "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy` → `Random Doping`：配比覆盖 + 占位多样性 + 额外局部替位。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy` -> "
#~ "`Random Doping`: composition coverage, occupation "
#~ "diversity, then additional local substitutions."

#~ msgid "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy` → `Atomic Perturb`：成分 + 占位 + 坐标噪声。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy` -> "
#~ "`Atomic Perturb`: composition, occupation, and "
#~ "coordinate noise."

#~ msgid "**输出和输入完全一样。** `elements` 少于 2 个元素，或 `order` 不合法，或 `max_outputs` <= 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is unchanged.** Check that `elements` "
#~ "has at least two entries, `order` is "
#~ "supported, and `max_outputs` is positive."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**标签成分和原子实际组成不一致。** 正常——Composition Sweep 只打目标配比标签，不改原子种类。需要接"
#~ " `Random Occupancy` 才会真正替换原子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Label fractions differ from actual species "
#~ "counts.** This is expected: Composition Sweep "
#~ "records a plan but does not replace "
#~ "atoms. Add `Random Occupancy` to realize it."

#~ msgid "**组合爆炸。** 5 元 + Grid + step=0.05 可产生上万个点。先用 `max_outputs` 卡住上限，小样本验证后再放量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Combinatorial explosion.** A five-component Grid"
#~ " at step 0.05 can contain tens of "
#~ "thousands of points. Set `max_outputs`, validate "
#~ "a small design, then increase it deliberately."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**某些 order 没有输出。** 检查 `budget_mode` 分配和 "
#~ "element 数量。只有 3 个元素但 order 含 4 和 5"
#~ " 时，程序自动跳过不可执行的组合。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Some orders have no output.** Check budget"
#~ " allocation and the element count. With "
#~ "only three elements, orders 4 and 5 are"
#~ " skipped."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入顺序可复现。Grid "
#~ "模式的网格点本身是确定性的，`use_seed` 主要影响组合选取顺序和 Sobol 生成。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce"
#~ " an input order. Grid points are "
#~ "deterministic; the seed mainly affects subset "
#~ "selection and Sobol generation."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 50，仅 Sobol 模式生效。目标采样点数，典型值 25-200。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default `50`; Sobol only. Requested sample count, commonly 25-200."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "在元素池和元数约束下生成成分设计空间。对选定元素集合按二元到五元组合展开，用网格或 Sobol 低差异序列在 simplex"
#~ " 上采样目标配比点，输出带 `Comp(...)` 标签的结构副本。本卡只生成目标配比计划，不真正落位——需要下游接 "
#~ "`Random Occupancy` 才能得到离散原子占位。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate a composition design space from an"
#~ " element pool and selected component counts. "
#~ "The card expands binary through quinary "
#~ "combinations and samples target fractions on "
#~ "each simplex with a grid or Sobol "
#~ "sequence. It outputs structure copies labeled "
#~ "`Comp(...)`; these labels are composition plans, "
#~ "not actual site occupations. Follow with "
#~ "`Random Occupancy` to assign discrete species."

#~ msgid "这张卡采样的是成分单纯形，而不是直接替换原子。对 $K$ 种元素，目标成分满足"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This card samples a composition simplex rather"
#~ " than replacing atoms directly. For $K$ "
#~ "elements, target compositions satisfy"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "x_e\\ge x_{\\min},\\qquad \\sum_{e=1}^{K}x_e=1.\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`网格`模式在这个约束面上枚举规则点；`Sobol`模式把低差异序列映射到同一约束面，适合在 有限预算下更均匀地覆盖高维成分空间。输出只把目标 "
#~ "$x_e$ 写入 `Comp(...)` 标签，元素占位 "
#~ "仍与输入相同；要得到真实化学结构，必须再接`随机占位`。预算分配会在每个输入结构之间回流 "
#~ "未用完名额，因此“最大输出数”是全流程上限，不保证每个输入得到相同数量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Grid` enumerates regular points on this "
#~ "constraint surface; `Sobol` maps a low-"
#~ "discrepancy sequence to the same surface and"
#~ " gives more even coverage of high-"
#~ "dimensional composition space under a finite "
#~ "budget. The output writes target $x_e$ values"
#~ " to the `Comp(...)` label while keeping "
#~ "element occupancy unchanged; append `Random "
#~ "Occupancy` to obtain real chemical structures. "
#~ "Unused budget is reflowed between inputs, so"
#~ " `Maximum outputs` is a workflow-wide limit"
#~ " and does not guarantee the same count "
#~ "per input."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在偏离训练集化学计量比时预测崩了"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: Predictions fail away from the training stoichiometry"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 Co-Cr-Ni 三元系上训练了一个 NEP 模型，训练数据全部来自等摩尔 "
#~ "CoCrNi 单相。模型对等摩尔构型的能量和力预测很好，但一跑 Co30Cr20Ni50 "
#~ "这种偏离等摩尔的组分，能量误差翻了三倍。诊断结果是：训练集所有数据的成分落在 simplex "
#~ "的一个点上，模型根本没有见过成分变化导致的局域化学环境差异。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A Co-Cr-Ni NEP is trained entirely "
#~ "on equiatomic CoCrNi. It performs well there,"
#~ " but its energy error triples at a "
#~ "composition such as Co30Cr20Ni50. All training "
#~ "compositions occupy one point of the simplex,"
#~ " so composition-dependent local chemistry is "
#~ "extrapolated."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** "
#~ "合金模型的基本要求是能在整个成分空间内插，而不是只记住一个成分点。如果训练集成分覆盖太窄，模型只能外推——成分漂得越远，误差越大。解决办法是先在目标成分空间内均匀撒一批配比点，再去下游逐个落位，让模型从头学起不同成分下的化学环境。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** An alloy model should interpolate "
#~ "across the intended composition domain, not "
#~ "memorize one composition. First design a "
#~ "well-distributed set of target fractions, then"
#~ " realize each target with downstream site "
#~ "occupation so the training set contains "
#~ "distinct chemical environments."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 CoCrNi 超胞结构（当前训练集里唯一的结构，等摩尔配比）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A relaxed equiatomic CoCrNi supercell,"
#~ " currently the only training composition."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 从 Co-Cr-Ni 三个元素出发，生成二元 + 三元所有配比的网格采样，约 500 个目标配比点，后续接 `Random Occupancy` 落地"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Objective:** Grid-sample all binary and "
#~ "ternary Co-Cr-Ni combinations up to "
#~ "about 500 targets, then realize them with "
#~ "`Random Occupancy`."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`元素`（`elements`） = `Co,Cr,Ni`"
#~ msgstr "`Elements` (`elements`) = `Co,Cr,Ni`"

#~ msgid "`组合元数`（`order`） = `2,3` （二元 + 三元组合）"
#~ msgstr "`Composition orders` (`order`) = `2,3` (binary + ternary combinations)"

#~ msgid "`采样方法`（`method`） = `Grid`，`成分步长`（`step`） = `0.1`"
#~ msgstr "`Sampling method` (`method`) = `Grid`, `Composition step` (`step`) = `0.1`"

#~ msgid "`每个输入的最大目标成分数`（`max_outputs`） = `500`"
#~ msgstr "`Maximum target compositions per input` (`max_outputs`) = `500`"

#~ msgid "**输出：** 约 500 个带 `Comp(Co=...,Cr=...,Ni=...)` 标签的结构副本。此时结构内原子种类未变，标签只是目标配比计划"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** About 500 structure copies labeled "
#~ "`Comp(Co=...,Cr=...,Ni=...)`. Atomic species are unchanged"
#~ " at this stage; the label records only "
#~ "the target composition."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后跑几个偏移等摩尔的测试组分，力的 MAE 应该不再随成分漂移而显著恶化"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After realization, labeling, and retraining, force"
#~ " MAE at several off-equiatomic tests should"
#~ " no longer deteriorate sharply with composition"
#~ " distance."

#~ msgid "检查 `Config_type` 中 Comp 标签的成分分布是否覆盖了 simplex 各区域——如果某些边角空白，减小 step 或换 Sobol 补点"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Plot the `Comp` fractions from `Config_type` "
#~ "and confirm coverage across each simplex. "
#~ "Reduce the grid step or use Sobol if "
#~ "corners or regions remain empty."

#~ msgid "如果全部集中等摩尔附近但没有边角覆盖，打开 `包含边界成分点`（`include_endpoints`），降低 `元素最小占比`（`min_fraction`）到 0"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If samples cluster near equimolar compositions "
#~ "without covering corners, enable `Include endpoint"
