#~ " are skipped."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `Grid`。`Grid` 用均匀网格采样，步长可控，适合低元数（2-3 元）。`Sobol` "
#~ "用低差异序列在高维 simplex 上覆盖更均匀，适合 4-5 元或点数有限的情况。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `Grid`. `Grid` uses a "
#~ "controlled uniform step and is convenient for"
#~ " binary or ternary spaces. `Sobol` gives "
#~ "more even limited-point coverage of four- "
#~ "or five-component simplexes."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.1，仅 Grid 模式生效。单位是成分分数，`0.1` 表示 10 "
#~ "个百分点。数值越小，网格越密、目标配比越多；典型值为 0.05-0.15。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 0.1, used only in Grid "
#~ "mode. The unit is a composition fraction; "
#~ "`0.1` means ten percentage points. Smaller "
#~ "values create a denser grid and more "
#~ "target compositions; typical values are 0.05–0.15."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 50，仅 Sobol 模式生效。它表示每一种元素组合通过 "
#~ "`元素最小占比`（`min_fraction`）约束后的目标有效点数，而不是过滤前的尝试数。operation 会继续补采样直到得到该数量；典型值为"
#~ " 25-200。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default 50, used only in Sobol "
#~ "mode. It is the number of valid target"
#~ " points for each element combination after "
#~ "applying `Minimum element fraction` (`min_fraction`), "
#~ "not the number of attempts before filtering."
#~ " Sampling continues until this count is "
#~ "reached; typical values are 25–200."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.0，范围 0-1。每个元素的最小占比下限。比如设为 0.05 意味着每个组分至少 "
#~ "5%，极端稀释的端点成分会被自动过滤掉。设 0 则不做下限约束。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0`, range 0-1. Minimum "
#~ "fraction of every included element. A value"
#~ " of 0.05 removes compositions below 5%; "
#~ "zero imposes no lower bound."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 true，仅 Grid 模式。勾选后保留纯元素端点和某个元素占比为零的边界成分；关掉后只保留所有元素占比均大于零的内部点。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default true, used only in Grid "
#~ "mode. When enabled, retain pure-element "
#~ "endpoints and boundary compositions where one "
#~ "element has zero fraction; when disabled, keep"
#~ " only interior points with every element "
#~ "fraction greater than zero."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定随机路径（Sobol 生成和组合选取），同参数同输入可复现。对比实验时打开，探索阶段可以关着。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Fix Sobol generation "
#~ "and combination selection for reproducible "
#~ "controlled comparisons."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。不同取值产生不同的采样分布。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Different values produce different sample designs."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 500。限制每个输入结构生成的目标配比总数，防止组合爆炸。超出预算时按 "
#~ "`输出预算分配`（`budget_mode`）规则分配到各组合元数；典型值为 250-1500。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default 500. Limits the total target"
#~ " compositions generated for each input structure"
#~ " to prevent combinatorial explosion. When the "
#~ "budget is exceeded, it is distributed among"
#~ " composition orders according to `Budget "
#~ "allocation` (`budget_mode`); typical values are "
#~ "250–1500."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `Equal+Reflow`。控制输出上限如何在不同组合元数之间分配。界面使用易读名称，保存值保持不变："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `Equal+Reflow`. Controls how the "
#~ "output limit is distributed among composition "
#~ "orders. The interface uses readable names "
#~ "while saved values remain unchanged:"

#~ msgid "`均衡各元数`（`Equal+Reflow`）：各元数先均分，未用完的名额再分给仍有候选点的元数，适合大多数场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Equal+Reflow`: split the budget evenly among "
#~ "orders first, then reassign unused slots to"
#~ " orders that still have candidate points; "
#~ "suitable for most cases."

#~ msgid "`旧版均分`（`Equal (legacy)`）：保留旧行为，各元数均分且不回流余量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Equal (legacy)`: preserve the old behavior, "
#~ "splitting the budget evenly without reflowing "
#~ "unused slots."

