#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Sobol + min_fraction 报告有效点不足。** 下限越接近等摩尔值 "
#~ "`1/order`，可接受区域越小。operation 会在明确的尝试预算内补采样；仍不足时抛出 "
#~ "`ValueError`，报告实际接受点数、目标点数和尝试次数，不会静默返回少量结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Sobol + min_fraction reports too few valid"
#~ " points.** The closer the lower bound is"
#~ " to the equimolar value `1/order`, the "
#~ "smaller the admissible region becomes. The "
#~ "operation resamples within an explicit attempt "
#~ "budget. If the target is still not "
#~ "reached, it raises `ValueError` with the "
#~ "accepted count, target count, and attempt "
#~ "count instead of silently returning a small"
#~ " dataset."

